WEBVTT

00:00:00.500 --> 00:00:04.560
17 Operator, please 
contact. At this rate...

00:00:09.210 --> 00:00:11.570
Anyway,

00:00:12.320 --> 00:00:14.940
you can see we've gotten 
our instruments together.

00:00:14.940 --> 00:00:16.070
We're starting a band!

00:00:16.070 --> 00:00:17.320
What?!

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:19.500
It'll be a girl's band,

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:21.910
so Noya's going to be dressed 
like this, of course.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.580
Okay...

00:00:24.190 --> 00:00:26.420
But why a band all of a sudden?

00:00:26.770 --> 00:00:29.050
They seem to be all the rage recently.

00:00:29.050 --> 00:00:31.580
Basically, we can't just sit 
around and look at the stars.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:34.800
We have to become stars ourselves.

00:00:36.450 --> 00:00:39.010
You just randomly came up with 
this, didn't you, Onee-sama?

00:00:39.010 --> 00:00:41.270
I kind of have a bad feeling 
about this, but...

00:00:41.270 --> 00:00:44.290
Respect is one thing, 
but if we screw up,

00:00:44.290 --> 00:00:47.030
we'll be bathing in a "tea time" 
filled with our own blood. Gulp.

00:00:47.030 --> 00:00:48.380
It'll be fine.

00:00:48.380 --> 00:00:49.770
Anyway, grab something you like.

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:51.500
Come on...

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.500
What is this?

00:00:51.500 --> 00:00:53.070
Okay, this.

00:00:51.670 --> 00:00:53.370
Should I take this one or this one?

00:00:53.370 --> 00:00:54.100
This one.

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.150
Is this even an instrument?

00:00:55.150 --> 00:00:57.360
Okay, let's try playing a song!

00:00:57.660 --> 00:01:00.780
One, two. One, two, three, four.

00:01:21.240 --> 00:01:29.060
Ebisugawa Public High School Astronomy Club

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:29.060
Ebiten

00:02:59.110 --> 00:03:04.120
<b>Viva Astronomy</b>

00:03:06.930 --> 00:03:08.360
This is good.

00:03:08.360 --> 00:03:10.910
We should drink tea after 
school all the time.

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:12.500
Indeed.

00:03:18.930 --> 00:03:22.340
Uh... So what happened 
to the band thing?

00:03:22.700 --> 00:03:24.700
No one can play an instrument.

00:03:24.700 --> 00:03:26.700
I'm too busy, anyway.

00:03:26.700 --> 00:03:28.760
Plus, there's grown-up 
things to worry about.

00:03:29.260 --> 00:03:31.000
Grown-up things?

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:33.230
Get a clue, already, Itsuki-sama!

00:03:33.230 --> 00:03:36.110
Do you want to be told off on Nico?

00:03:36.110 --> 00:03:38.030
I don't really understand 
what you're talking about,

00:03:38.030 --> 00:03:39.250
but sorry...

00:03:40.190 --> 00:03:41.030
That's right.

00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:44.720
The only thing we can do now 
is be quiet and have our tea.

00:03:47.610 --> 00:03:48.810
This is good.

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:51.870
We should drink tea after 
school all the time.

00:03:51.870 --> 00:03:53.230
No. This isn't enough.

00:03:53.230 --> 00:03:54.120
Huh?

00:03:54.470 --> 00:03:56.260
Wait, Todayama...

00:03:56.690 --> 00:03:58.260
You still wanna try this?

00:03:59.540 --> 00:04:01.210
It's true that musical 
instruments are difficult,

00:04:01.210 --> 00:04:02.690
and I don't want to deal with them,

00:04:02.690 --> 00:04:04.130
but I want to have a band.

00:04:04.790 --> 00:04:06.690
Then what are you suggesting?

00:04:06.690 --> 00:04:07.640
This!

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:11.730
<b>T-mon Club</b>

00:04:07.640 --> 00:04:13.640
<b>We want band 
members now!</b>

00:04:08.550 --> 00:04:11.020
"We want band members now!"

00:04:09.560 --> 00:04:13.640
<b>We have five vocalists waiting. 
Accepting members now</b>

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.640
"We have five vocalists waiting."

00:04:11.020 --> 00:04:13.640
<b>We're in the old school building basement.</b>

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:15.820
That might work.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.130
If people who can play 
the guitar, bass, drums,

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.930
and keyboard apply, we'll be able 
to start a band right away.

00:04:22.350 --> 00:04:24.780
I'd never apply, though.

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:27.120
This still isn't enough!

00:04:27.120 --> 00:04:28.580
In order to get people to sign up,

00:04:28.580 --> 00:04:30.740
we're going to make a promotion 
video to get more people to apply!

00:04:30.740 --> 00:04:32.160
What?!

00:04:34.230 --> 00:04:35.880
<i>Waste time in class,</i>

00:04:35.880 --> 00:04:37.830
<i>And focus on after school</i>

00:04:37.830 --> 00:04:39.270
<i>Rush in as soon as the bell rings</i>

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:40.620
<i>The clubroom is heaven 
and it feels great</i>

00:04:40.970 --> 00:04:42.790
<i>We're still trying to 
figure out what to do</i>

00:04:42.790 --> 00:04:44.790
<i>Handsome fantasies with Perseus</i>

00:04:44.790 --> 00:04:47.900
<i>In the middle of a never-ending show</i>

00:04:47.900 --> 00:04:51.410
<i>A wonderful, dazzling appearance</i>

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.260
<i>It's okay to never back down</i>

00:04:55.110 --> 00:04:56.800
<i>Only sometimes an Astronomy Club</i>

00:04:56.800 --> 00:05:00.570
<i>The yama-moe Astronomy Club</i>

00:05:01.860 --> 00:05:05.030
<i>Viva Viva taking it easy</i>

00:05:05.030 --> 00:05:06.350
<i>Do everything you can 
that you want to do</i>

00:05:06.350 --> 00:05:07.230
<i>Eat as much as you want</i>

00:05:07.230 --> 00:05:08.800
<i>I'm having a sandwich for lunch</i>

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.890
<i>Viva Viva doing your thing</i>

00:05:11.890 --> 00:05:13.310
<i>I can't wait to know my fortune</i>

00:05:13.310 --> 00:05:14.130
<i>Sparkling comets</i>

00:05:14.130 --> 00:05:15.250
<i>You've only got one chance</i>

00:05:15.250 --> 00:05:16.850
<i>For your wish</i>

00:05:18.620 --> 00:05:20.640
This is our promotion video?

00:05:21.180 --> 00:05:22.560
There was some stuff mixed in there

00:05:22.560 --> 00:05:24.040
that I think I've seen before...

00:05:24.040 --> 00:05:26.070
Also, a while ago, after the show ended

00:05:26.070 --> 00:05:29.030
that introduced "cool bands," 
there was another show

00:05:29.030 --> 00:05:31.350
that came on called "Ebiten" 
in the same time-slot.

00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.900
So we're done now, Todayama-senpai?

00:05:34.900 --> 00:05:36.640
No, not even close.

00:05:38.950 --> 00:05:42.110
Animals really help add 
to the replay count.

00:05:42.110 --> 00:05:44.470
A cat just needs to be soft.

00:05:44.470 --> 00:05:45.830
That's so true.

00:05:45.830 --> 00:05:49.420
Look at how cute Neko-sensei is...

00:05:52.310 --> 00:05:54.790
Wait! Wait!

00:05:54.790 --> 00:05:57.720
I love how cold she is.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.390
Everyone follow me!

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:02.000
We're going to film!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.290
Hey, wait, Todayama!

00:06:12.630 --> 00:06:17.220
Oh my. When did Todayama-san start this?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:18.520
Huh?

00:06:18.980 --> 00:06:20.480
It looks like you're doing something

00:06:20.480 --> 00:06:22.360
weird again, aren't you, Astronomy Club?

00:06:23.240 --> 00:06:27.280
Pretty ridiculous to have an 
Astronomy Club start a band.

00:06:29.570 --> 00:06:32.310
And you're trying to recruit members?

00:06:32.310 --> 00:06:35.320
Like you'd just stumble upon someone

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.120
who can play instruments.

00:06:35.320 --> 00:06:37.120
You think you can film closer?

00:06:37.120 --> 00:06:40.120
I think she'll be on guard.

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:42.790
You're totally getting shut 
down if you start a band.

00:06:43.510 --> 00:06:46.590
But, you know...

00:06:48.400 --> 00:06:52.550
I wouldn't really mind... You know?

00:06:52.550 --> 00:06:56.250
She looks like she's going to be 
a complete pain to deal with.

00:06:56.960 --> 00:06:58.690
Neko-sensei's on the move.

00:06:58.690 --> 00:06:59.270
What?

00:06:59.270 --> 00:07:00.060
Let's go!

00:07:02.740 --> 00:07:04.800
Hey, wait!

00:07:05.200 --> 00:07:06.510
President Iseda?

00:07:07.280 --> 00:07:08.620
Hasumi?!

00:07:11.070 --> 00:07:12.780
Th-This isn't what it looks like!

00:07:12.780 --> 00:07:14.640
I was just kind of...

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:15.810
This is a wallet!

00:07:15.810 --> 00:07:17.100
A new type of wallet!

00:07:17.100 --> 00:07:19.500
This is where you put your change.

00:07:19.500 --> 00:07:21.250
Pretty avant-garde, don't you think?

00:07:40.560 --> 00:07:43.630
So where did Neko-sensei 
come from, anyway?

00:07:43.630 --> 00:07:46.580
Isn't she Oomori-sensei's cat?

00:07:47.110 --> 00:07:47.860
Huh?

00:07:47.860 --> 00:07:49.340
Where are we?

00:07:56.210 --> 00:07:57.240
Hey! That's...

00:07:57.240 --> 00:07:58.620
Oomori-sensei?!

00:07:58.620 --> 00:08:00.230
The human version.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.210
I wonder what she's doing.

00:08:08.780 --> 00:08:10.310
Hi there.

00:08:11.830 --> 00:08:14.120
Darling, are you there?

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:15.980
Are you not home?

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:18.220
Darling!

00:08:18.220 --> 00:08:19.380
Sniff, sniff.

00:08:19.380 --> 00:08:21.720
I brought him a lunch, too.

00:08:22.710 --> 00:08:24.450
Oh well.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:26.390
Let's see.

00:08:28.950 --> 00:08:30.720
Here you go. Open wide.

00:08:32.270 --> 00:08:34.890
Eat up.

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:36.960
Here's another bite.

00:08:38.190 --> 00:08:39.780
Why in the mail slot?

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.450
Well, this is shocking footage.

00:08:39.780 --> 00:08:41.450
Is it good?

00:08:41.450 --> 00:08:43.450
Oh, thank goodness.

00:08:41.800 --> 00:08:43.450
Shouldn't we stop her?

00:08:43.450 --> 00:08:46.970
No, this is interesting, 
so let's keep watching for a bit.

00:08:47.910 --> 00:08:50.050
There you go.

00:08:52.640 --> 00:08:56.170
Darling, was the food good?

00:08:56.170 --> 00:09:00.620
Don't worry. I'll make you 
another lunch tomorrow.

00:09:05.230 --> 00:09:05.910
Kiss.

00:09:06.480 --> 00:09:09.610
Oh, me! Oh, me! Oh, me!

00:09:11.380 --> 00:09:13.860
I can't believe we got this on film.

00:09:13.860 --> 00:09:15.900
It's turned into a horror film.

00:09:15.900 --> 00:09:17.920
What should we do? 
Turn it over to the police?

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:19.260
Our teacher?

00:09:19.260 --> 00:09:21.430
Is that something a 
teacher should be doing?

00:09:21.430 --> 00:09:23.120
Hey, guys.

00:09:24.450 --> 00:09:25.410
Neko-sensei.

00:09:25.410 --> 00:09:26.630
Oomori-sensei.

00:09:27.660 --> 00:09:30.510
Yes, this is Oomori-Neko-sensei.

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:33.860
I'm just a simple girl in love.

00:09:33.860 --> 00:09:34.730
Right.

00:09:34.730 --> 00:09:36.640
What were you doing?

00:09:36.640 --> 00:09:39.300
Just giving a little 
something to my boyfriend.

00:09:39.300 --> 00:09:40.720
Oh, how embarrassing.

00:09:40.720 --> 00:09:42.660
Giving him something? Like that?

00:09:42.660 --> 00:09:44.350
No, that was pretty weird.

00:09:44.350 --> 00:09:46.140
I think she's harassing him.

00:09:46.140 --> 00:09:48.360
H-How mean!

00:09:48.360 --> 00:09:50.730
You guys are saying that, too?!

00:09:50.730 --> 00:09:52.940
The same thing as he did...

00:09:54.130 --> 00:09:57.150
"It's okay, Shouko. I'm fine.

00:09:57.150 --> 00:09:59.470
Come back after you start 
acting a little cuter."

00:09:59.470 --> 00:10:02.090
He said that!

00:10:00.190 --> 00:10:02.090
Who's "he"?

00:10:02.090 --> 00:10:03.680
Her previous boyfriend, probably.

00:10:03.680 --> 00:10:08.210
He's not my previous boyfriend! 
We're still currently dating!

00:10:08.210 --> 00:10:10.330
It looks like you secretly 
took that picture of him...

00:10:10.330 --> 00:10:13.460
I haven't been talking to him at all,

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:15.150
but he's just not talking to me because

00:10:15.150 --> 00:10:17.020
he's worried about how busy I am.

00:10:17.020 --> 00:10:20.720
But I come to his house every day.

00:10:20.720 --> 00:10:24.680
I give him his lunch through his 
mail slot every day, too. Tee-hee.

00:10:25.100 --> 00:10:29.310
I call him from morning until I 
go to sleep, and text him, too.

00:10:27.940 --> 00:10:28.860
What?

00:10:28.860 --> 00:10:30.160
Sounds like a problem.

00:10:29.310 --> 00:10:31.940
I send him telegraphs from 
morning until I go to sleep...

00:10:30.160 --> 00:10:31.940
She's completely stalking him.

00:10:31.940 --> 00:10:34.350
Love's blind, you know?

00:10:34.350 --> 00:10:35.750
I don't think this has anything to do with love.

00:10:36.240 --> 00:10:38.860
What do you know about love?!

00:10:39.570 --> 00:10:44.100
I want to see him so badly, 
even though we're so far apart...

00:10:44.100 --> 00:10:46.830
I can't stop worrying 
when I'm not near him.

00:10:47.320 --> 00:10:50.580
That's what love is really like.

00:10:50.580 --> 00:10:51.800
Right...

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:55.430
You should know how I feel, 
given how you went out of your way

00:10:52.470 --> 00:10:54.010
Huh?! Wha—

00:10:55.430 --> 00:10:57.460
to transfer to this school 
to chase after Noya-kun!

00:10:57.460 --> 00:10:59.600
You two are in love.

00:11:00.310 --> 00:11:04.050
I'm just working for 
Itsuki-sama as his maid...

00:11:04.620 --> 00:11:05.470
I...

00:11:12.730 --> 00:11:13.790
There he is!

00:11:16.790 --> 00:11:17.820
Sigh.

00:11:18.900 --> 00:11:19.990
Why...

00:11:20.840 --> 00:11:23.240
Why do you pretend you're not there.

00:11:24.420 --> 00:11:27.350
I miss you. I miss you.

00:11:25.750 --> 00:11:27.350
This is bad.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:29.630
I miss you!

00:11:28.050 --> 00:11:29.630
Stop the crime!

00:11:35.020 --> 00:11:36.500
This smells like...

00:11:48.100 --> 00:11:49.590
We stopped her in time.

00:11:49.590 --> 00:11:51.140
Is she sleeping?

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.020
Yeah.

00:11:52.590 --> 00:11:55.060
Anyway, we got some good 
footage. Let's go back.

00:11:55.060 --> 00:11:58.120
Huh? But Oomori-sensei's...

00:11:58.120 --> 00:11:59.490
She's fine.

00:11:59.490 --> 00:12:01.160
Just leave her lying there.

00:12:01.160 --> 00:12:02.750
She'll wake up eventually.

00:12:02.750 --> 00:12:04.910
Anyway, let's get going Itsuki-sama.

00:12:05.750 --> 00:12:07.270
S-Sure.

00:12:10.630 --> 00:12:11.900
A-Are you okay?

00:12:11.900 --> 00:12:13.960
Maybe we should increase your dosage.

00:12:13.960 --> 00:12:18.160
I'm fine, Elizabeth. Thanks.

00:12:22.970 --> 00:12:25.560
So much in love.

00:12:36.650 --> 00:12:38.900
Huh? Where did everyone go?

00:12:39.330 --> 00:12:41.280
They left not too long ago saying they

00:12:41.280 --> 00:12:42.860
were going to put up more posters.

00:12:45.650 --> 00:12:47.720
They should be back soon.

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:48.410
Huh?

00:12:48.410 --> 00:12:50.110
Huh? What is it?

00:12:50.670 --> 00:12:52.790
It won't open!

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:56.750
What's going on?

00:12:59.500 --> 00:13:01.550
Wh-What should we do...

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:09.280
So what do you hope to 
accomplish here, Todayama?

00:13:10.510 --> 00:13:13.810
I've been wanting to get something 
more interesting on film.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:17.140
It is after school, during the evening.

00:13:17.520 --> 00:13:19.680
The setting sun releases special waves

00:13:19.680 --> 00:13:21.690
that cause living organisms to breed.

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:23.820
Men and women who bathe 
in the light from

00:13:23.820 --> 00:13:25.450
the setting sun become 
sexually stimulated...

00:13:25.450 --> 00:13:26.850
The club room's underground.

00:13:26.850 --> 00:13:28.140
They're not going to see the sun.

00:13:29.120 --> 00:13:30.480
Who cares?!

00:13:30.480 --> 00:13:32.670
Besides, whether it be in 
erogames or light novels,

00:13:32.670 --> 00:13:34.370
a young couple will 
always have their

00:13:34.370 --> 00:13:36.010
first experience together after 
school, in a classroom!

00:13:36.010 --> 00:13:38.400
Ebiten isn't an erogame 
or a light novel.

00:13:44.400 --> 00:13:46.340
What are we going to do with her?

00:13:46.340 --> 00:13:47.990
Now, now...

00:13:47.990 --> 00:13:50.810
Izumiko can just sit 
there quietly and watch.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:53.780
Any luck?

00:13:53.780 --> 00:13:55.440
No, I don't think we're 
going to get anywhere.

00:13:55.990 --> 00:13:57.270
Let me try.

00:13:59.340 --> 00:14:00.680
Sorry!

00:14:00.680 --> 00:14:02.240
Why are you apologizing?

00:14:02.240 --> 00:14:03.790
Oh, it's just...

00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:06.630
I was told not to get very close

00:14:06.630 --> 00:14:08.480
to any other girls besides Elizabeth.

00:14:08.770 --> 00:14:10.280
Izumiko-chan said that?

00:14:10.280 --> 00:14:11.200
Yes.

00:14:12.990 --> 00:14:14.200
I see.

00:14:14.630 --> 00:14:18.180
I think Todayama's up to 
her old tricks here.

00:14:18.180 --> 00:14:19.840
Todayama-senpai?

00:14:19.840 --> 00:14:21.260
Why her?

00:14:21.260 --> 00:14:24.590
Who'd ever get suddenly 
trapped in a room?

00:14:24.830 --> 00:14:26.450
Oh, yeah.

00:14:26.450 --> 00:14:29.420
Maybe there's something that 
can force the door open.

00:14:29.420 --> 00:14:31.970
Let's go look through the 
random junk in the room.

00:14:31.970 --> 00:14:32.760
Sure.

00:14:35.430 --> 00:14:37.170
Could you hold this steady for me?

00:14:37.170 --> 00:14:38.340
Sure.

00:14:38.340 --> 00:14:39.920
There we go.

00:14:41.820 --> 00:14:43.690
Oh yeah, Noya-kun.

00:14:45.430 --> 00:14:47.440
Don't look up.

00:14:53.320 --> 00:14:55.120
No!

00:14:57.740 --> 00:14:59.590
Ow...

00:15:06.040 --> 00:15:08.240
I-I-I'm sorry!

00:15:11.590 --> 00:15:15.870
I-I'm fine...

00:15:19.840 --> 00:15:20.960
Ow...

00:15:21.980 --> 00:15:23.290
Is something wrong?

00:15:23.690 --> 00:15:24.930
Are you okay?

00:15:24.930 --> 00:15:26.520
I'm fine...

00:15:26.520 --> 00:15:28.220
Just a little dizzy.

00:15:28.220 --> 00:15:29.560
Oh no...

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:31.140
Want to lie down for a bit?

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:33.550
Sorry. No, I'm fine.

00:15:33.550 --> 00:15:34.990
This always happens.

00:15:35.460 --> 00:15:38.010
This is going a little better 
than I thought it would.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:39.250
Hey...

00:15:40.150 --> 00:15:40.990
Take that!

